@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Method / document navigation. Scope-independent process/navigation; provider or runner examples are not MVP prerequisites.
 title Resumefolio - Planning review and baseline acceptance
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #DBEAFE
  BorderColor #94A3B8
  FontColor #17324D
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
  DiamondBorderColor #94A3B8
  StartColor #17324D
  EndColor #17324D
}
start
:Identify planning revision and assess PC-01 through PC-13;
:Record evidence, corrections and remaining gaps;
if (Review complete?) then (yes)
  if (Blocking gaps remain?) then (yes)
    :Rework required - assign corrections and reassess;
    stop
  else (no)
    if (Non-blocking gaps need deferral?) then (yes)
      :Record reasons, owner, actions and dependent review gates;
      :Obtain owner acceptance of the specific deferrals;
      :Propose Accepted with tracked follow-up;
    else (no)
      :Propose Accepted;
    endif
    :Project owner records actual review outcome\nagainst the identified Git revision;
    :Preserve decision and follow-up in version control;
  endif
else (not yet)
  :Pending - continue the evidence review;
endif
stop
legend bottom
Recording a proposal is not an owner acceptance decision.
Planning acceptance does not verify technical capacity or authorize coding.
Later revisions need assessment; a commit alone is not acceptance.
endlegend
@enduml
